Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.41,Hook,,0,0,0,,ROBAR EL CAMPO DE TIRO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cuánto dinero tengo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿140?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No creo que me alcance\Npara un chaleco,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}la verdad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Sabes qué? Vamos al campo\Nde tiro y robamos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}el campo de tiro, en\Nserio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Dios mío.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Pensé que me estaban\Ndisparando a mí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me estaba volviendo loco.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Esto es mala idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es mala idea. Es mala\Nidea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ya sé, me puse codicioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:18.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me ganó la codicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Creo que no es buena idea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}robar un lugar donde todos\Nandan armados.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Sabes qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:34.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vamos a asaltar la casa de\Nempeño. Lo haremos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:35.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Lo haremos!
